The return value of the method `RemoveAt()` is used in the assertion statement of the form `Debug.Assert(RET >= 0 && RET <= _size);`. We can conclude that it will never violate the assertion as long as the index is not negative and smaller or equal to the count of items in the list (`_size`). 

